  "title": "8:31P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d607de673c0847e1137b7b94b5e64b42dde0f18818b1b8d016c966858dfe456f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "呀吼~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "注意看路啦，能天使姐，不要单手扶握把！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "总算跟上你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "德克萨斯......下一次......请慢一点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "抱、抱歉。我已经尽量控制了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "既然咱们已经汇合，那么下一步就是去找老板啦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "慢着，我怎么觉得少了点什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......拜松呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "欸？不应该是你们带着他走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "......难道我们把他丢在那儿了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......习惯了我们自己的节奏，突然多出来一个人，是会把他忘掉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "——那我们是不是得赶紧回去帮忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不是有莫斯提马在吗？问题不大吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "喂——！等，等我一下！咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "......自行车？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "唔噢！靠自行车就能追上德克萨斯的速度，拜松他挺行的嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "喂！他往哪个巷子去了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "那个方向！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "他身后还跟着一大批人喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "你不能奢求一个人骑着自行车还能甩开一整支武装黑手党。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......不对，有埋伏，能天使！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "但好像有点来不及了喔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "总、总算追上他们了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "是啊，辛苦你带路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "谁——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "睡一小会吧，小少爷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "啧，慢了一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "晚上好，企鹅物流的各位，我是甘比诺·里奇，家族的首领。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "很遗憾，人质在我们手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "不过，你们也不是会因为这点小事就乱了手脚的人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "本来就是我们把他忘了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "倒、倒也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "你想怎样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "哼......你们东躲西藏的，实在让人厌烦。动静闹太大，对大家都不好，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "这个小少爷的确还有点用处。有了人质，你们就只能正面应战，别无选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "这样能为我省掉不少麻烦，能动手解决的问题，都是最好解决的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "企鹅物流，你们现在无处可逃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "原来如此。那可真是太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "毕竟我们也是这么想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "可颂和空维持阵型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "能天使注意掩护。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "抢回拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
